==== (3) THE KINDS ON FILE touching the chapter's matter ====
  kinds 1125, effects 1025
    add_nothing_commanded                        form statute  the exhortation with the one law — 'and now, Israel, hear the statutes and the judgments which I tea
    affliction_oath_case                         form case     the exam's rows on the affliction oath and the day (Num 30:14-16 — Nedarim 76b-77b, 79a-83b, 87a-87b
    altar_built                                  form case     an altar built — the clauses 'an altar of earth you shall make for Me' and 'and if an altar of stone
    altar_commanded                              form speech   an altar commanded — 'and God said to Jacob: arise, go up to Bethel and dwell there, and make there 
    altar_erected                                form act      an altar erected — Noah's (8:20), Abram's at Shechem (12:7), east of Bethel (12:8), at Hebron (13:18
    altar_fire_tended                            form case     the altar's fire tended — 'this is the law of the burnt offering: it is the burnt offering on its py
